#X text 20 620 The state table is this route box \; mother's eight colors are on the Organelle's Reference page. Stopped is lit rather than dark \, so a stopped patch cannot look like a dead one., f 58;
#X text 20 740 led is a reserved disp selector: g_oled matches it and drops it. C-5, f 58;
#X text 760 240 No list append before the second route: running already arrives as the selector., f 44;
#X text 760 640 The reject branch needs one: a reject carries a bare symbol \, which the trigger cannot convert. C-8, f 44;
#X text 20 880 mother sets led 0 on quitting \, so the safe exit needs nothing here. No layers \, decided: ref/module/display.md., f 58;
